        <headline>Dense Fog Advisory issued September 25 at 1:25AM CDT until September 25 at 9:00AM CDT by NWS Grand Forks ND</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Visibility less than one mile in dense fog.

* WHERE...Ransom and Sargent Counties.

* WHEN...Until 9 AM CDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make driving conditions hazardous.
</description>
        <instruction>If driving, slow down, use your headlights, and leave plenty of
distance ahead of you.</instruction>
